flowchart TD
    A[Inbound Email] -->|HMAC + idempotency-key| B[email-webhook]
    B --> C[Nora Intake<br/>classify intent + language]
    C --> D[Nora<br/>sender -> CRM contact]
    D --> E[Nora<br/>extract logistics fields]
    E --> F{Validation<br/>weight, dims, times complete?}
    F -- No --> G[Escalation<br/>operational_tasks escalation]
    F -- Yes --> H[Pricing engine<br/>resolve pricing + create quote]
    H --> I{Pricing gate<br/>price > 0?}
    I -- No --> G
    I -- Yes --> J[outbound_reply_queue<br/>send quote to customer]
    J --> K[Orion<br/>interpret reply]
    K -- accepted --> L[Carrier Intelligence<br/>4-stage pipeline]
    K -- revise --> H
    K -- reject --> Z1[quote: rejected]
    L --> M{Overall confidence<br/>>= min_confidence?}
    M -- No --> N[requires_manual_review]
    M -- Yes --> O[Booking<br/>shipment: booked]
    N --> O
    O --> P[Tracking<br/>in_transit -> delivered]
    O --> U{Nora<br/>sender a known customer?}
    U -- No --> V[Nora<br/>ask for company name, org nr,<br/>contact person, address]
    V --> W[Customer replies<br/>Nora registers the new customer]
    P --> Q[tracking-simulator<br/>auto-create invoice]
    Q --> R[Invoice audit<br/>discrepancy vs quote]
    R -- <= max_discrepancy --> S[invoice_approved]
    R -- > max_discrepancy --> T[invoice_disputed]
